Luigi,
I can not say too much about the netrom side of it, I have it running but
not too much used. We use mostly the ROSE side under fpac. Indeed
if you want to try that you can go to www.f6fbb.org and then select the
fpac button on the left side of the page. FPAC will set up the ROSE
part, all you have to do is the local switch file.

We have a FPAC list and indeed you could connect your FPAC to the
network here and in France over the internet if your Linux machine has
internet access.

